WEBVTT

00:04:27.902 --> 00:04:30.248
because just when we thought
the war was won,

00:04:30.272 --> 00:04:33.210
a bunch of 20th-century physicists
came to the party,

00:04:33.234 --> 00:04:35.913
and they revealed
that the laws of the universe,

00:04:35.937 --> 00:04:38.532
the same laws that modern
cryptography was built upon,

00:04:39.422 --> 00:04:41.237
they aren't as we thought they were.

00:04:42.205 --> 00:04:45.716
We thought that one object couldn't be
in two places at the same time.

00:04:46.262 --> 00:04:47.803
It's not the case.

00:04:47.827 --> 00:04:51.539
We thought nothing can possibly spin
clockwise and anticlockwise

00:04:51.563 --> 00:04:52.848
simultaneously.

00:04:53.265 --> 00:04:54.652
But that's incorrect.

00:04:55.173 --> 00:04:58.883
And we thought that two objects
on opposite sides of the universe,

00:04:58.907 --> 00:05:01.208
light years away from each other,